Sat Oct 17 16:03:57 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.5.0 from the new d3adb5 upstream fork:
  - Build system switched from autotools to meson
  - New features: ignoring window classes; scrolling outside the tray;
    drag-and-drop icon reordering with order kept across restarts;
    reaction to monitor changes; live configuration reloading;
    absolute tray positioning and virtual-display positioning;
    slot_gap and slot_size settings
  - Bug fixes: settings reloading logic; negative command line values;
    XGetClassHint failures
  - Packaging changes:
    - Source URL moved to github.com/d3adb5/stalonetray
    - Drop fix-docbook-root.patch (autotools gone); add
      stalonetray-docbook-root.patch for the meson manpage build
    - New BuildRequires: meson, pkgconfig(xinerama),
      pkgconfig(xrandr), pkgconfig(cmocka); unit tests run in %check
    - Sample configuration is now installed as
      %{_sysconfdir}/stalonetrayrc

